1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:03,834
Every creator dreams of earning from YouTube.

2
00:00:03,834 --> 00:00:07,330
But how does the money reach your bank? The answer:

3
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:08,358
Google AdSense.

4
00:00:09,608 --> 00:00:12,049
I'll show the whole process:

5
00:00:12,049 --> 00:00:14,839
applying to the Partner Program,

6
00:00:14,839 --> 00:00:16,321
creating AdSense,

7
00:00:16,321 --> 00:00:17,803
PIN verification,

8
00:00:17,803 --> 00:00:20,419
adding your bank and tax info.

9
00:00:21,319 --> 00:00:24,388
And I'll show where people go wrong,

10
00:00:24,388 --> 00:00:27,202
so your payment never gets stuck.

11
00:00:27,202 --> 00:00:28,225
Let's begin.

12
00:00:29,725 --> 00:00:30,150
First,

13
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:31,566
how the money flows:

14
00:00:31,566 --> 00:00:34,115
YouTube shows ads on your videos and

15
00:00:34,115 --> 00:00:36,735
shares part of that revenue with you.

16
00:00:37,985 --> 00:00:40,389
It doesn't go straight to your bank.

17
00:00:40,389 --> 00:00:43,595
It collects in your AdSense for YouTube account,

18
00:00:43,595 --> 00:00:46,266
then gets sent to your bank every month.

19
00:00:47,516 --> 00:00:49,460
How big is your share?

20
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:53,259
About 55% of the ad revenue on long videos,

21
00:00:53,259 --> 00:00:54,849
and 45% on Shorts.

22
00:00:56,099 --> 00:00:58,708
Earnings also depend on your topic and

23
00:00:58,708 --> 00:01:00,356
where your viewers are —

24
00:01:00,356 --> 00:01:02,759
so every channel earns differently.

25
00:01:04,009 --> 00:01:06,385
So don't treat AdSense as just a form —

26
00:01:06,385 --> 00:01:08,457
it's the locker for your earnings.

27
00:01:08,457 --> 00:01:10,590
Every detail in it must be correct.

28
00:01:12,090 --> 00:01:14,085
When should you set up AdSense?

29
00:01:14,085 --> 00:01:16,466
Once your channel is eligible for the

30
00:01:16,466 --> 00:01:18,397
YouTube Partner Program (YPP).

31
00:01:18,397 --> 00:01:19,555
In YouTube Studio,

32
00:01:19,555 --> 00:01:21,035
click Earn on the left.

33
00:01:23,735 --> 00:01:26,152
Here you can see your channel's progress.

34
00:01:26,152 --> 00:01:27,331
Under current rules,

35
00:01:27,331 --> 00:01:29,395
the Partner Program has two levels.

36
00:01:30,645 --> 00:01:31,340
Level 1:

37
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:32,730
500 subscribers,

38
00:01:32,730 --> 00:01:35,161
3 public uploads in 90 days,

39
00:01:35,161 --> 00:01:38,722
plus 3,000 watch hours in 12 months or 3M

40
00:01:38,722 --> 00:01:40,807
Shorts views in 90 days.

41
00:01:42,057 --> 00:01:44,901
This unlocks fan funding like memberships

42
00:01:44,901 --> 00:01:46,149
and Super Thanks —

43
00:01:46,149 --> 00:01:47,467
but not ad revenue.

44
00:01:48,717 --> 00:01:51,669
For ad revenue you need level 2:

45
00:01:51,669 --> 00:01:55,358
1,000 subscribers plus 4,000 watch hours

46
00:01:55,358 --> 00:01:56,558
in 12 months,

47
00:01:56,558 --> 00:01:59,417
or 10M Shorts views in 90 days.

48
00:02:00,667 --> 00:02:05,232
Only public long-form watch hours count —

49
00:02:05,232 --> 00:02:07,459
not Shorts, private,

50
00:02:07,459 --> 00:02:10,465
unlisted or deleted videos.

51
00:02:11,715 --> 00:02:13,053
Not eligible yet?

52
00:02:13,053 --> 00:02:15,966
Click 'Get notified' on this page and

53
00:02:15,966 --> 00:02:18,800
YouTube will email you once you are.

54
00:02:20,050 --> 00:02:23,656
Watch hours and Shorts views don't add up —

55
00:02:23,656 --> 00:02:25,417
complete one of them.

56
00:02:25,417 --> 00:02:28,603
YouTube changes these rules over time,

57
00:02:28,603 --> 00:02:30,783
so always check in Studio.

58
00:02:32,283 --> 00:02:33,323
Before applying,

59
00:02:33,323 --> 00:02:35,014
make sure of three things.

60
00:02:36,014 --> 00:02:36,315
One:

61
00:02:36,315 --> 00:02:39,246
2-Step Verification must be on for your

62
00:02:39,246 --> 00:02:40,373
Google account.

63
00:02:41,623 --> 00:02:41,936
Two:

64
00:02:41,936 --> 00:02:45,149
no active Community Guidelines strikes on

65
00:02:45,149 --> 00:02:46,168
your channel.

66
00:02:47,418 --> 00:02:48,027
Three,

67
00:02:48,027 --> 00:02:49,549
most important:

68
00:02:49,549 --> 00:02:51,274
original content.

69
00:02:51,274 --> 00:02:55,536
'Reused content' is the most common reason

70
00:02:55,536 --> 00:02:57,768
channels get rejected.

71
00:02:59,268 --> 00:03:01,974
Reviewers look at your whole channel:

72
00:03:01,974 --> 00:03:03,071
its main theme,

73
00:03:03,071 --> 00:03:05,266
most-viewed and newest videos,

74
00:03:05,266 --> 00:03:07,606
and titles and descriptions too.

75
00:03:08,856 --> 00:03:10,346
So before applying,

76
00:03:10,346 --> 00:03:13,248
delete or make private any old copied

77
00:03:13,248 --> 00:03:15,444
videos or misleading titles.

78
00:03:16,944 --> 00:03:17,545
All set?

79
00:03:17,545 --> 00:03:18,445
Let's apply.

80
00:03:18,445 --> 00:03:21,373
Step one is the Partner Program terms —

81
00:03:21,373 --> 00:03:24,000
click START next to 'Review Partner

82
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,126
Program terms'.

83
00:03:27,726 --> 00:03:30,593
They explain how revenue is shared and

84
00:03:30,593 --> 00:03:32,705
which rules you must follow.

85
00:03:32,705 --> 00:03:33,837
Read them once,

86
00:03:33,837 --> 00:03:35,195
then click Accept.

87
00:03:38,195 --> 00:03:39,183
Step two:

88
00:03:39,183 --> 00:03:42,695
Sign up for AdSense for YouTube.

89
00:03:42,695 --> 00:03:44,012
Click START.

90
00:03:46,812 --> 00:03:49,960
Now pick a Google account. A key rule:

91
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:54,186
only one AdSense account is allowed per payee name.

92
00:03:55,436 --> 00:03:57,142
Already have AdSense,

93
00:03:57,142 --> 00:03:58,604
say for a website?

94
00:03:58,604 --> 00:04:00,553
Don't create a new one —

95
00:04:00,553 --> 00:04:04,452
choose that Gmail and link the existing account.

96
00:04:05,702 --> 00:04:06,872
I don't have one,

97
00:04:06,872 --> 00:04:09,213
so I'll pick my channel's account.

98
00:04:11,513 --> 00:04:14,191
Your channel is already filled in.

99
00:04:14,191 --> 00:04:16,476
Choose India as the country —

100
00:04:16,476 --> 00:04:18,524
it can't be changed later,

101
00:04:18,524 --> 00:04:19,627
so be careful.

102
00:04:20,877 --> 00:04:24,559
Then accept the terms and click Continue.

103
00:04:27,059 --> 00:04:29,206
Now the payee information —

104
00:04:29,206 --> 00:04:31,194
details of who gets paid.

105
00:04:31,194 --> 00:04:34,056
Keep the account type as Individual.

106
00:04:35,306 --> 00:04:39,895
Type your name exactly as in your bank account —

107
00:04:39,895 --> 00:04:41,233
same spelling.

108
00:04:41,233 --> 00:04:44,770
A mismatch puts your payment on hold.

109
00:04:46,020 --> 00:04:49,243
Use the address where you actually live

110
00:04:49,243 --> 00:04:50,400
and get post —

111
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:54,367
Google will mail a PIN letter here. No P.O. box.

112
00:04:55,617 --> 00:04:57,419
If a phone number is asked,

113
00:04:57,419 --> 00:04:59,153
enter your active number —

114
00:04:59,153 --> 00:05:01,689
a verification code may be sent to it.

115
00:05:02,939 --> 00:05:04,494
Check everything once,

116
00:05:04,494 --> 00:05:05,766
then click Submit.

117
00:05:09,766 --> 00:05:12,491
AdSense is linked. Step three:

118
00:05:12,491 --> 00:05:13,763
Get reviewed —

119
00:05:13,763 --> 00:05:17,487
YouTube's team will look at your channel.

120
00:05:18,737 --> 00:05:21,433
This usually takes about a month.

121
00:05:21,433 --> 00:05:25,191
Keep uploading and follow the rules meanwhile.

122
00:05:26,441 --> 00:05:30,986
You can track the review on this same Earn page —

123
00:05:30,986 --> 00:05:34,326
and YouTube emails you the decision.

124
00:05:35,576 --> 00:05:36,521
If rejected,

125
00:05:36,521 --> 00:05:37,466
don't panic:

126
00:05:37,466 --> 00:05:39,198
appeal within 21 days,

127
00:05:39,198 --> 00:05:43,134
or improve your content and reapply after 30 days.

128
00:05:44,384 --> 00:05:46,201
And once you're approved,

129
00:05:46,201 --> 00:05:47,364
you'll see this!

130
00:05:47,364 --> 00:05:49,617
Ads can now run on your videos.

131
00:05:51,717 --> 00:05:53,611
Next important step:

132
00:05:53,611 --> 00:05:55,220
PIN verification.

133
00:05:55,220 --> 00:05:57,587
Open AdSense for YouTube.

134
00:05:59,387 --> 00:06:02,512
Once your earnings pass a small threshold,

135
00:06:02,512 --> 00:06:05,710
Google posts a 6-digit PIN to your address.

136
00:06:05,710 --> 00:06:08,463
It usually takes 2–4 weeks to arrive.

137
00:06:09,713 --> 00:06:10,944
When it arrives,

138
00:06:10,944 --> 00:06:14,023
click Verify address and enter your PIN.

139
00:06:17,523 --> 00:06:18,108
Submit,

140
00:06:18,108 --> 00:06:20,532
and your address is verified.

141
00:06:20,532 --> 00:06:23,373
You get 4 months to enter the PIN;

142
00:06:23,373 --> 00:06:26,967
3 wrong tries can stop payments. No letter?

143
00:06:26,967 --> 00:06:29,391
Request a new PIN in AdSense.

144
00:06:30,641 --> 00:06:34,048
The PIN arrives as a plain letter from Google.

145
00:06:34,048 --> 00:06:35,604
Don't throw it away —

146
00:06:35,604 --> 00:06:38,344
many people mistake it for junk mail.

147
00:06:39,844 --> 00:06:41,764
Now let's add your bank account.

148
00:06:41,764 --> 00:06:43,384
Click Payments on the left.

149
00:06:45,184 --> 00:06:46,667
Under How you get paid,

150
00:06:46,667 --> 00:06:48,923
click Add payment method. In India,

151
00:06:48,923 --> 00:06:51,759
money comes straight into your bank account.

152
00:06:54,359 --> 00:06:56,189
Account holder name —

153
00:06:56,189 --> 00:06:58,194
the same as in AdSense.

154
00:06:58,194 --> 00:07:01,070
Then the bank name and IFSC code,

155
00:07:01,070 --> 00:07:04,382
found on your passbook or cheque book.

156
00:07:05,632 --> 00:07:08,186
Enter the account number twice,

157
00:07:08,186 --> 00:07:09,834
tick Set as primary,

158
00:07:09,834 --> 00:07:11,070
and click Save.

159
00:07:15,370 --> 00:07:16,024
Remember:

160
00:07:16,024 --> 00:07:19,151
the bank account must be in your own name —

161
00:07:19,151 --> 00:07:20,823
the same as in AdSense.

162
00:07:20,823 --> 00:07:23,222
Never use someone else's account.

163
00:07:24,472 --> 00:07:27,206
Money is sent in dollars and arrives in

164
00:07:27,206 --> 00:07:29,309
your bank converted to rupees;

165
00:07:29,309 --> 00:07:31,622
your bank may deduct a small fee.

166
00:07:33,122 --> 00:07:33,563
Next,

167
00:07:33,563 --> 00:07:35,858
the step most people skip:

168
00:07:35,858 --> 00:07:36,917
US tax info.

169
00:07:36,917 --> 00:07:40,888
Earnings from US viewers are taxed in the US.

170
00:07:43,088 --> 00:07:44,314
If it's missing,

171
00:07:44,314 --> 00:07:48,069
up to 24% of your total earnings can be withheld.

172
00:07:48,069 --> 00:07:48,682
With it,

173
00:07:48,682 --> 00:07:50,981
thanks to the India–US treaty,

174
00:07:50,981 --> 00:07:54,123
only US-viewer earnings are taxed at 15%.

175
00:07:55,373 --> 00:07:57,367
Click Add tax info.

176
00:07:57,367 --> 00:08:00,936
Choose Individual, US person: No —

177
00:08:00,936 --> 00:08:03,035
your form is W-8BEN.

178
00:08:04,835 --> 00:08:07,420
Claim treaty benefits for India, Article 12,

179
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:08,301
enter your PAN,

180
00:08:08,301 --> 00:08:10,122
sign with your name and submit.

181
00:08:14,622 --> 00:08:15,172
Done —

182
00:08:15,172 --> 00:08:18,836
only 15% is now withheld on US earnings.

183
00:08:18,836 --> 00:08:22,134
You can claim it as a credit in your

184
00:08:22,134 --> 00:08:23,875
Indian tax return —

185
00:08:23,875 --> 00:08:24,974
ask your CA.

186
00:08:26,474 --> 00:08:27,513
Now the fun question:

187
00:08:27,513 --> 00:08:28,552
when do you get paid?

188
00:08:28,552 --> 00:08:29,889
At the start of each month,

189
00:08:29,889 --> 00:08:31,670
last month's earnings are finalised.

190
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:35,842
If your balance is over the payment threshold —

191
00:08:35,842 --> 00:08:36,588
about $100 —

192
00:08:36,588 --> 00:08:37,458
with no holds,

193
00:08:37,458 --> 00:08:40,628
you're paid between the 21st and 26th of the month.

194
00:08:41,878 --> 00:08:42,832
For example:

195
00:08:42,832 --> 00:08:46,093
October's earnings are finalised in early

196
00:08:46,093 --> 00:08:50,148
November and reach your bank around 21–26 November.

197
00:08:51,398 --> 00:08:52,352
Below the threshold?

198
00:08:52,352 --> 00:08:54,547
Your earnings simply roll over to next month —

199
00:08:54,547 --> 00:08:55,310
nothing is lost.

200
00:08:56,810 --> 00:08:58,745
If a payment ever gets stuck,

201
00:08:58,745 --> 00:09:01,813
look for a 'payment hold' message in AdSense —

202
00:09:01,813 --> 00:09:03,214
usually it's the PIN,

203
00:09:03,214 --> 00:09:04,882
tax info or bank details.

204
00:09:06,382 --> 00:09:06,867
Finally,

205
00:09:06,867 --> 00:09:09,173
the mistakes that block payments. One:

206
00:09:09,173 --> 00:09:11,236
creating a second AdSense account.

207
00:09:12,486 --> 00:09:12,779
Two:

208
00:09:12,779 --> 00:09:16,221
different names in AdSense and the bank. Three:

209
00:09:16,221 --> 00:09:17,392
a wrong address,

210
00:09:17,392 --> 00:09:19,223
so the PIN never arrives.

211
00:09:20,473 --> 00:09:20,886
Four:

212
00:09:20,886 --> 00:09:22,375
skipping tax info,

213
00:09:22,375 --> 00:09:24,607
so extra tax gets deducted.

214
00:09:26,107 --> 00:09:27,257
A safety tip:

215
00:09:27,257 --> 00:09:30,885
avoid anyone promising 'AdSense approval'

216
00:09:30,885 --> 00:09:32,743
or fast monetization.

217
00:09:32,743 --> 00:09:36,547
Never share your AdSense or Gmail password.

218
00:09:38,047 --> 00:09:38,995
Quick recap:

219
00:09:38,995 --> 00:09:40,496
eligibility, terms,

220
00:09:40,496 --> 00:09:42,786
AdSense account, review, PIN,

221
00:09:42,786 --> 00:09:44,840
bank account and tax info.

222
00:09:46,090 --> 00:09:48,578
Found this helpful? Like, subscribe,

223
00:09:48,578 --> 00:09:52,032
and ask any question in the comments — I'll reply.

224
00:09:52,032 --> 00:09:53,829
See you in the next video!

